<Project>

  <!--
    Shared MSBuild targets for every XHT project.

    Per /Documents/XHT.html Rev 6 Section 2.5: this file hosts the
    git-tag-derived Version property used by XHT.Entry's `version` mode
    (Section 1.1) to compose the printed
        XHT v{semver}+{git-short-hash} ...
    line. The git-tag derivation logic ships in Phase 1b alongside the
    real version mode; this scaffold leaves the property surface empty
    so the plumbing exists and can be extended without restructuring
    the tree.

    Mirrors the XBT precedent at
    /Engine/Source/Programs/XBT/Directory.Build.targets.
  -->

</Project>
